	measure 'Sales Difference with Icon Short' = ```
			
			VAR Difference = [Monthly_YTD_Sales v2] - [Monthly_Previous_Sales]
			VAR Icon = [Sales Difference Icon]
			VAR AbsValue = ABS(Difference)
			VAR FormattedValue = 
			    SWITCH(
			        TRUE(),
			        AbsValue >= 1000000, FORMAT(Difference / 1000000, "$#,0.##") & "M",
			        AbsValue >= 1000, FORMAT(Difference / 1000, "$#,0.##") & "K",
			        FORMAT(Difference, "$#,0")
			    )
			RETURN FormattedValue & " " & Icon
			```
