	measure 'R12 Margin Difference with Icon R12 Short' = ```
			
			VAR Difference = [R12M_Margin_Difference]
			VAR Icon = [Margin Difference Icon R12]
			VAR AbsValue = ABS(Difference)
			VAR FormattedValue = 
			    SWITCH(
			        TRUE(),
			        AbsValue >= 1000000, FORMAT(Difference / 1000000, "$#,0.##") & "M",
			        AbsValue >= 1000, FORMAT(Difference / 1000, "$#,0.##") & "K",
			        FORMAT(Difference, "$#,0")
			    )
			RETURN FormattedValue & " " & Icon
			```
		lineageTag: a6dbf00a-113c-461e-a7d4-08d50f09719b

